      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not a binary choice; we can achieve significant savings while retaining critical intelligence. Instead of the full Autonomous module, we can deploy a distilled, lightweight inference endpoint utilizing spot instances for the analysis phase. This reduces the fixed compute overhead dramatically while providing essential predictive flagging during deployments. This hybrid approach maintains operational foresight at a much lower cost, balancing budget adherence with pipeline reliability.",
      "source": "target",
